caption: Example 4 — Embodied Self-Buff
tradition-component: example-4-embodied-self-buff

A High Mage with Dragon Animal Embodiment and Magery 6 casts a legal self-targeted High Magic working using Dragon as its Animal Word to grant a package of draconic traits, such as Flight and additional DR. She may declare the working an Embodied Self-Buff. If the combined package fits within the normal single-buff potency and point-value caps, the entire casting occupies one of her six Embodied Self-Buff slots and lasts indefinitely until dismissed or otherwise removed. A second qualifying self-casting occupies another slot. These buffs stack with other legal temporary or permanent magical buffs because Animal Embodiment uses its own buff track.
